                                "sense_id": "0dce7a15-edc8-3e97-a0a0-12575609f644",
                                "text": "Dhirubhai Ambani's first home in Mumbai was nearly as humble as the ones the gawking labourers inhabit: a pigeonhole chawl four kilometres from Antilia, in the pushcart-clogged trading neighbourhood of Bhuleshwar."
